    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="meta">Effective date: January 24, 2026 · Service: <a href="https://split-era.vercel.app/">https://split-era.vercel.app/</a></p>

    <p>At SplitEra (&quot;we,&quot; &quot;us,&quot; or &quot;our&quot;), we value your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and protect your information when you use our website and app (the &quot;Service&quot;). By using the Service, you consent to the practices described here.</p>

    <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
    <p><strong>Personal information:</strong> When you sign up or log in, we may collect your name, email address, password (hashed), country code, phone number, and optional profile photo.</p>
    <p><strong>Authentication data:</strong> For Google sign-in, we collect information provided by Google, such as your name and email.</p>
    <p><strong>Usage data:</strong> We may collect data on how you interact with the Service, including IP address, browser type, device information, and timestamps.</p>
    <p><strong>Expense data:</strong> Information you input, such as expense amounts, descriptions, categories, and group participants (which may include others&apos; names or emails if shared).</p>
    <p><strong>Recovery data:</strong> For password resets, we may collect your email or phone number and use OTPs.</p>

    <h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>To provide and maintain the Service (e.g. account creation, expense tracking, group sharing).</li>
        <li>To authenticate you and secure your account.</li>
        <li>To communicate with you, including service updates or OTPs.</li>
        <li>To improve the Service through analytics.</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How we share your information</h2>
    <p><strong>Service providers:</strong> We may share data with third parties for hosting, analytics, or authentication (e.g. Google for sign-in), bound by confidentiality.</p>
    <p><strong>Group features:</strong> If you share expenses in groups, other users may see your shared data.</p>
    <p><strong>Legal requirements:</strong> We may disclose information if required by law or to protect rights.</p>
    <p><strong>We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</strong></p>

    <h2>4. Data security</h2>
    <p>We use industry-standard measures such as HTTPS and password hashing. No system is completely secure; you are responsible for safeguarding your credentials.</p>

    <h2>5. Data retention</h2>
    <p>We retain personal information as long as your account is active or as needed to provide the Service. Upon account deletion, we may retain data for legal or backup purposes for up to 30 days.</p>

    <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
    <p>You may access, update, or delete your information by logging in or contacting us. Depending on your location, you may have additional rights (e.g. under GDPR or applicable Indian data protection laws).</p>

    <h2>7. Children&apos;s privacy</h2>
    <p>The Service is not intended for children under 13 (or 16 in some jurisdictions). We do not knowingly collect data from children.</p>

    <h2>8. International transfers</h2>
    <p>Your data may be stored and processed in India or other countries. We aim to use appropriate safeguards for transfers.</p>

    <h2>9. Cookies and tracking</h2>
    <p>We use cookies for session management and analytics where applicable. You can manage cookies in your browser settings.</p>

    <h2>10. Third-party links</h2>
    <p>The Service may link to third-party sites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices.</p>

